{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ludus Magnatus: Gladiator Manager Simulator is a classic management experience set in an alternate Ancient Rome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in Division VII with one of sixteen clubs, recruit fighters, equip them from the market, and climb the ladder through fully simulated seasons and matches with AI that plays exactly like players. Build momentum, overcome rival ludi, and carry your team toward promotion and the ultimate title of champion of the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088670/extras/ef2db9a283e926625cf13318bdb0b1fb.avif?t=1768769029\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every match tells a story. Watch recruits grow into legends or fall forever in fast and dramatic arena fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088670/extras/dc7ba0a0f1c492e7cc8c2336a181ecb8.poster.avif?t=1768769029\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088670/extras/dc7ba0a0f1c492e7cc8c2336a181ecb8.webm?t=1768769029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088670/extras/dc7ba0a0f1c492e7cc8c2336a181ecb8.mp4?t=1768769029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088670/extras/921764b2edd533471c1922863ae52db4.avif?t=1768769029\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your fighters are the heart of your Ludus. See their fame grow with victories, upgrade th